      "comment": "THE TIGER ARMY (6) is hard to knock off back-to-back wins here. Worked forward from this barrier last week and dug deep to score, getting there by a neck. Finds a tougher race but he is going well enough to land the hat-trick. WEHAVTIME NZ (2) has been competitive from wider barriers of late and kept the ball rolling last time when fourth at Albion Park. A nice draw on the front line should ensure a cosy run. Good enough to win a race of this calibre. BRITTS MATE NZ (8) has a strong record here so must be a chance on the back of a good win last week, his second success from his last three appearances. KEAYANG MOSCATO (5) has claims off a win here three back.",
